cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or engine, please cite it as below."
title: "λ-Normalization Census: open data and engine for normalization geometry of the untyped λ-calculus"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, dependency-free engine and open dataset classifying closed
  untyped lambda-terms (de Bruijn natural size, OEIS A275057) as strongly
  normalizing, weakly-but-not-strongly normalizing (separators), or
  non-normalizing — exact for small size and Monte-Carlo beyond. Reports the
  smallest closed WN-but-not-SN term (natural size 13) and the separator-density
  curve, framed against the proven SN-density asymptotics, plus a companion
  Barendregt-Geuvers-Klop conservation lab.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Lodri
    given-names: Peter
    alias: peterlodri-sec
repository-code: "https://github.com/peterlodri-sec/lambda-normalization-census"
license: MIT
